k you.","zh":"谢谢。"},"body":{"en":"We have everything we need from {{customer}} for now. We will be in touch soon with a quote.","zh":"我们已收到 {{customer}} 的全部信息，稍后会把报价发给您。"}}}', 'seed', '2026-11-26T00:00:00.000Z');
